    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23855" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insĭmŭlātĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insĭmĭl-</span></b> ), ōnis,
